2. Recover the whole canonical field.
3. Draft in station dependency order.
4. Apply recursive reading during composition.
5. Run cold reader and G1–G10 review.
6. Run comparative and negation audit.
7. Calibrate selectively.
8. Revise through the repair hierarchy.
9. Run seam, thread, source, register, and whole-work reviews.
